  "title": "Edit packet-ltp.c for correcting LTP SDA dissection",
  "description": "I found current LTP dissection does not display LTP SDA type of packets properly. [related issue I reported](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/20684)\n\nI tracked down the packet-ltp.c source file and found its solution. tvb should be changed to new_tvb because it holds all the concatenated data block. I also changed description of service id value for BP and LTP SDA according to RFC-7116.",
